{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_92CE3C1E","title":"Decisons Decisions","entry":"Dlg_92CE3C1E::entry","exit":"Dlg_92CE3C1E::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_93511567","articyId":"72057778721525834","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Are you here to comment on the current situation unfolding here on Calypso Island?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you here to comment on the current situation unfolding here on Calypso Island?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1769.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49492","byteOffset":33065856,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_857F0021","articyId":"72057778721525855","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Reality?! You don't think this is reality? A glowing city of glitz, glam, and gobsmacked citizens weaving through the confines of their lives? What could be more reality than that?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Reality?! You don't think this is reality? A glowing city of glitz, glam, and gobsmacked citizens weaving through the confines of their lives? What could be more reality than that?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36754","byteOffset":28247736,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_D799C7A1","articyId":"72057778721525875","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Of course we are! We couldn't actually be on Calypso Island, not with what's going on there?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course we are! We couldn't actually be on Calypso Island, not with what's going on there?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40410","byteOffset":29615752,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_4D1B72C9","articyId":"72057778721525885","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Can't you see it?! Waves of happiness as lush trees give way to scantily clad beach goers enjoying the lustful lounging of their desires.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can't you see it?! Waves of happiness as lush trees give way to scantily clad beach goers enjoying the lustful lounging of their desires.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51163","byteOffset":33769176,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_D233C48C","articyId":"72057778721525907","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Throwing words together? Yes. Random words? No. That's what an announcer does, they string syllables into sentences and convey information to the viewers and readers and streamers like you.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Throwing words together? Yes. Random words? No. That's what an announcer does, they string syllables into sentences and convey information to the viewers and readers and streamers like you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3550.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52292","byteOffset":34197024,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_8C065AFC","articyId":"72057778721525914","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Cirian! What a sponsor! They're the type of person you want on your side when the advert gods decide to pull out of your system. Haha, pull out. Sorry! Sorry, everyone! That was inappropriate. Can we take it again from the top?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Cirian! What a sponsor! They're the type of person you want on your side when the advert gods decide to pull out of your system. Haha, pull out. Sorry! Sorry, everyone! That was inappropriate. Can we take it again from the top?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3549.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40080","byteOffset":29491968,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_309C3175","articyId":"72057778721525935","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"What is that? Is it a new version of the In Dreams tech? Let me tell you, I haven't felt this blissful in ages.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What is that? Is it a new version of the In Dreams tech? Let me tell you, I haven't felt this blissful in ages.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4150.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44531","byteOffset":31176416,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_7847A2B1","articyId":"72057778721525949","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Incredibly.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Incredibly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5037.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16471","byteOffset":14128952,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_574FC98A","articyId":"720577